flowchart TD
  A[User asks agent to perform task] --> B[Agent plans next step]
  B --> C{Tool required?}
  C -- yes --> D[Validate tool capability]
  D --> E{Approval needed?}
  E -- yes --> F[Suspend and request approval]
  E -- no --> G[Execute tool call]
  F --> H[Resume after approval]
  H --> G
  G --> I{Tool succeeded?}
  I -- yes --> J[Update run state]
  I -- no --> K[Record failure evidence]
  K --> L{Retry safe?}
  L -- yes --> G
  L -- no --> M[Stop with actionable error]
  J --> N[Final response]
